@startuml ContextMap

title ITJobs — Context Map (Mapa de Contextos Acotados)

left to right direction

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BorderColor #888888
    FontSize 13
}
skinparam arrow {
    Color #555555
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #F9A825
    FontSize 10
}

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
'  SHARED KERNEL (centro)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
rectangle "Shared Kernel\n──────────────────\nDomainEvent\nDomainEventPublisher\nEmail · UserId · Timestamp" as SHARED #E8EAF6

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
'  BOUNDED CONTEXTS  ✅ implementado | 🔲 pendiente
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
rectangle "Authentication ✅\n──────────────────\nUserAggregate\nRegister · Login · Google\nVerifyEmail · ChangePassword\nForgotPassword" as AUTH #E8F5E9

rectangle "Jobs ✅\n──────────────────\nJobAggregate\nCreateJob · SearchJobs" as JOBS #E3F2FD

rectangle "Profiles 🔲\n──────────────────\nCandidateAggregate\nEmployerAggregate\nRecruiterAggregate" as PROF #FBE9E7

rectangle "Applications 🔲\n──────────────────\nApplicationAggregate\nApplyToJob · SavedJobs" as APPS #FFF8E1

rectangle "Administration 🔲\n──────────────────\nCategoryAggregate\nUserManagementUseCase" as ADMIN #F3E5F5

rectangle "Moderation 🔲\n──────────────────\nContentReportAggregate\nModerationUseCase" as MOD #EFEBE9

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════
'  RELACIONES ENTRE CONTEXTOS
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════

' Shared Kernel — todos dependen de él
AUTH  --> SHARED : usa value objects\ny eventos
JOBS  --> SHARED : usa value objects\ny eventos
APPS  --> SHARED : usa eventos
PROF  --> SHARED : usa value objects
ADMIN --> SHARED : usa value objects
MOD   --> SHARED : usa eventos

' Authentication → publica eventos consumidos por otros contextos
AUTH ..> PROF  : UserRegisteredEvent\n(crea perfil vacío)
AUTH ..> ADMIN : UserRegisteredEvent\n(gestión de roles)

' Jobs → publica eventos
JOBS ..> APPS  : JobCreatedEvent\nJobClosedEvent

' Profiles provee identidad a Applications
PROF --> APPS  : CandidateAggregate\n(referencia)
PROF --> JOBS  : EmployerAggregate\ncrea ofertas

' Applications consume Jobs + Profiles
APPS --> JOBS  : lee JobAggregate\n(valida OPEN)

' Administration gestiona Jobs (categorías) y Authentication (usuarios)
ADMIN --> JOBS  : categoriza ofertas
ADMIN --> AUTH  : activa/desactiva\nusuarios

' Moderation observa Jobs y Applications
MOD --> JOBS : reporta ofertas
MOD --> APPS : reporta postulaciones

note bottom of AUTH
  Ver auth-overview.puml
  para detalle interno
  de use cases y puertos
end note

@enduml